4. Mathematical-result status

| Result | Audit status | Key qualification |
|---|---|---|
| Self-adjointness/core/lower bound/compact resolvent | proven in stated domain | Relative-bound and compact-embedding arguments are coherent; spectrum counted with multiplicity. |
| Whittaker–Ince recurrence and continued fraction | proven for physical slice, `F != 0` | Origin compatibility, minimal/dominant dichotomy, Bargmann summability, and simplicity are explicitly linked. |
| Undriven case | exact, separate | Possible degeneracies and relabelling are acknowledged; driven normalization is not applied at `F=0`. |
| Liouville gauge/singularities/DCHE map | algebraically proven/formal where labeled | Branches and local-vs-global limitations are repeatedly explicit. |
| Olver sectorial solutions | proven within stated sectors/hypotheses | Fixed-parameter Volterra bounds do not claim global origin-to-infinity connection. |
| Strong-drive leading coefficient | proven from double-root geometry | Next coefficient depends on stated global-connection conjecture. |
| Bogoliubov expansion | formal algebraic check | Correctly not promoted to a spectral proof. |
| Fedoryuk branches | local/formal; global quantization conditional | Orientation and H1–H3 are plainly conjectural. |
| Weak-drive expansion | formal nondegenerate perturbation theory | Source line 2373 gives the necessary nondegeneracy exclusion; zero/pole qualifications for resummation are explicit. |
| Iteration portraits | exploratory only | Numerical regularization, out-of-regime panels, intervention rates, and nonphysical status are disclosed. |

Dimensional/convention audit: `Delta = omega_c - omega_d` and `+ hbar Delta N`
are consistently stated. Both strong- and weak-drive sections use the
dimensionless `delta = hbar Delta / V`; `eta = |F|/V` and `lambda = |F|/V`
are dimensionless. Energies are divided by `V` where required. No contrary
detuning sign was found.

The contribution and novelty boundary is legible: the exact recurrence and
spectral condition, sectorial analysis, and drive expansions are distinguished
from prior coherent-state/dissipative work and from conjectural connection
formulae. The abstract, introduction, summary, outlook, captions, and
acknowledgment use consistent epistemic labels. Numerical agreement is not
presented as proof.

